# Glob patterns excluded from the uploaded build artifact.
# Consumed by actions/upload-artifact's `ignore` parameter.
# Each pattern is matched against the uploaded tree, so `**/` is used to
# match entries at any depth.
**/CMakeFiles/**
**/*_autogen/**
**/.qt/**
**/.ninja_deps/**
**/.ninja_log/**
**/build.ninja
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/cmake_install.cmake
**/Desktop_*-Release/**
**/zlib/**
